1
00:00:00,282 --> 00:00:02,912
Raj? It's Penny, are you in there?

2
00:00:03,085 --> 00:00:04,575
(Raj:)Hang on.

3
00:00:07,022 --> 00:00:10,422
Hey. I'm coming back from the airport.
I wanted to see how you're doing.

4
00:00:10,592 --> 00:00:13,822
(Raj:)That's very nice of you.
Come, come. Come on in.

5
00:00:14,797 --> 00:00:18,597
I can't stay long. I left Sheldon in the car
with the window cracked open.

6
00:00:20,836 --> 00:00:24,706
(Penny:)He's gonna go through that
activity book in, like, 30 seconds, so...

7
00:00:26,442 --> 00:00:27,532
(Penny:)Are you okay?

8
00:00:29,745 --> 00:00:31,215
(Raj:)No.

9
00:00:32,815 --> 00:00:34,945
(Penny:)I'm so sorry.

10
00:00:36,218 --> 00:00:37,708
(Raj:)It's my fault.

11
00:00:37,886 --> 00:00:42,946
I finally found someone who's right for me
and I drove her away.

12
00:00:44,193 --> 00:00:45,683
(Scene:)Raj.

13
00:00:46,829 --> 00:00:48,349
(Sheldon:)Penny...

14
00:00:48,630 --> 00:00:50,430
(Raj:)...I miss her already.

